This is the time of year
when my friend {04 0b 00}
likes to fish the most.
{07 04 00}{04 0b 00} caught
{04 1a 00}
out at sea last year!{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 06 00}If I don't catch one this
year, I'll never live it
down, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

I guess this is when the
{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}
is in season.
{07 16 00}You hardly ever see them,{01 00 00 0f 00}
{07 0e 00}but I hear that ponds are
a good place to look.

